{"id":"u-1a134135-bb26-4d4f-91d9-5ef41a874094","src":"community","title":"TH Upper/Lower 5/3/1 (WIP) SST","author":"Tom H.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/th-upper-lower-5-3-1-wip-sst-1","desc":"Upper / Lower 4 days a week with 5/3/1 Main Lift Programming (Bench, Squat, OH Press, Deadlift) assistance work based on Jim Wendler’s Simplest Strength Template. Currently a work in progress. \n\nWhen you enter your 1 Rep Max for your Squat, Bench, Deadlift and Military Press should be 90% of your actual 1 Rep Max. At the end of your cycle add 2.5kg to your last cycle Bench and Press Max and 5kg to your Squat and Deadlift. Repeat. Once you fail a main lift retest actual 1 rep max, take 90% and start again. \n\nAccessories build up slowly. Start conservative. If you can do the full reps then add the minimum possible weight and build up through the rep range again over a few weeks. If it feels mega easy and you are getting full reps with a lot in reserve then you can maybe progress faster initially.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-14T12:35:00.414Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":40},{"r":5,"pct":50},{"r":3,"pct":60},{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}],"note":"Last Set AMRAP"},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hyperextension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":40},{"r":5,"pct":50},{"r":3,"pct":60},{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75},{"r":5,"pct":85}],"note":"AMRAP Last Set"},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single Arm Iso Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"Dumb bell or barbell row if no iso machine."},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x"